# Fragment: doc_7af4_chunk_0319.ttl
hpc:Jobpreproctimeout a owl:Class .
hpc:JOB_PREPROC_TIMEOUT rdfs:comment "JOB_PREPROC_TIMEOUT cannot be defined in the user environment. On UNIX and Linux, sbatchd kills the entire process group of the job's pre-execution processes. On Windows, only the parent process of the pre-execution command is killed when the timeout expires, the child processes of the pre-execution command are not killed." .

